  "description": "VR games have taken the world by storm, but Jin Seojun had to quit after collapsing when his body failed to sync with the system. Fortunately, the company behind a new VR device offers him a second chance: enter a top-streamer tournament with the device on loan, and keep it if he wins. Those around him doubt he'll make it, but they don't know he was once Nameless, the Sword God. With his legendary sword skills and zero streamer instincts, he's about to turn the gaming world upside down! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
